{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  task 0004 (Task 1) — About Page, Section 3: "Our Sourcing & Quality Standards" (4 image cards)
  ============================================================================
  Structurally identical to task 0003's "Why Growers Choose" pattern (image + gradient fade +
  bottom-left icon badge + title + description) — per 0004_task1_intent.md, this is a
  near-direct reuse rather than a fresh design. Content from AboutPage.tsx in the Hydrogen
  reference.

  REUSES blocks/bfbella-benefit-card.liquid AS-IS for its block type — no new block file for
  this section. Per this project's file-handling rule ("reuse snippets and sections when
  possible") and the intent doc's own call, this section's cards are visually the same
  component as Task 3's benefit cards, just new icons and new copy/images. The 4 new icon
  options (Sprout, Beaker, Shield, TreePine) were already added to the live
  blocks/bfbella-benefit-card.liquid as part of installing this section in the 2026-09-07
  live-edit pilot — purely additive, all 6 original icons/options untouched.

  CONTENT: zero real copy hardcoded — heading, subheading, and every card field are blank
  native settings/block fields until DXB fills them in. See 0004_task1_howto.md for the exact
  production text and which two of the four images are Pexels photos already used elsewhere in
  this build (cheap to re-source) vs. new to this task.

  COLOR: no hardcoded hex. Accent (icon badges) resolves through `section.settings.accent_color`,
  falling back to `color_palette.color3`. Background resolves through
  `section.settings.background_color`, falling back to `color_palette.color9` — same dark
  treatment as bfbella-why-choose.liquid, since this is a photo-card grid like that section, not
  a light page-intro section like Task 1/2 above it on this page.

  2026-09-07 UPDATE: DXB liked the dark default but wanted the ABILITY to change both background
  and text color if needed later, not just background. Added `text_color`, resolved the same way
  as every other color here — falls back to `settings.color_palette.background` (this palette's
  white swatch, a native reference, not a literal hex) when left blank — and exposed as
  `--bfbella-text`. blocks/bfbella-benefit-card.liquid's title/description now read
  `var(--bfbella-text, #fff)` instead of a hardcoded white — the `#fff` there is a CSS-level
  fallback for the one other place that block is used (bfbella-why-choose.liquid, which doesn't
  set `--bfbella-text` and wasn't asked to change), not a schema default, so nothing about that
  section's appearance changes.

  DEPLOY: written directly into this live repo's working tree as part of the 2026-09-07
  live-edit pilot (see claude_docs/build_docs/live_edit_pilot_plan.md) — a deliberate exception
  to this project's normal task-folder-only rule, for this trial only. Claude still did not
  commit or push this — DXB reviews, then commits and pushes by hand.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign accent = section.settings.accent_color | default: settings.color_palette.color3
  assign bg = section.settings.background_color | default: settings.color_palette.color9
  assign text_color = section.settings.text_color | default: settings.color_palette.background

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id, skip_contrast: true
  endif
%}

<div
  id="AboutSourcing-{{ section.id }}"
  class="bfbella-about-sourcing{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
  style="
    --bfbella-accent: {{ accent }};
    --bfbella-bg: {{ bg }};
    --bfbella-text: {{ text_color }};
    {% if section.settings.padding_top != blank %}--bfbella-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.padding_bottom != blank %}--bfbella-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;{% endif %}
  "
>
  <div class="bfbella-about-sourcing__inner page-width">

    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
      <div class="bfbella-about-sourcing__intro">
        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="bfbella-about-sourcing__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
          <p class="bfbella-about-sourcing__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="bfbella-about-sourcing__grid">
        {% content_for 'blocks' %}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bfbella-about-sourcing {
    position: relative;
    padding-block-start: var(--bfbella-pad-top, 6rem);
    padding-block-end: var(--bfbella-pad-bottom, 6rem);
    background-color: var(--bfbella-bg);
    color: var(--bfbella-text, #fff);
  }

  .bfbella-about-sourcing__inner {
    max-width: 80rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-sourcing__intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-block-end: 4rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-sourcing__heading {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-block-end: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bfbella-about-sourcing__subheading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bfbella-text, #fff) 60%, transparent);
  }

  .bfbella-about-sourcing__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "BFBella — About Sourcing",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "bfbella-benefit-card"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "Accent color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Used for the icon badges. Leave blank to use the theme's existing color3 (brand green) swatch."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Leave blank to use the theme's existing color9 swatch — matches the dark treatment of the homepage's Why Choose section."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Applies to the heading, subheading, and every card's title/description. Leave blank to use the theme's Background swatch (reads as white against the dark default background) — change this if you pick a light background above."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 96
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 96
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "BFBella — About Sourcing",
      "category": "Custom",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "bfbella-benefit-card" },
        { "type": "bfbella-benefit-card" },
        { "type": "bfbella-benefit-card" },
        { "type": "bfbella-benefit-card" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
